SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Forwarding out of zone nazoos-waydroid, so Android reaches the internet
and the local network. Traffic to this computer itself (HOST) is not
covered by "ANY", there the zone's services apply.
Doku: https://firewalld.org/documentation/man-pages/firewalld.policies.html
-->
<policy target="ACCEPT">
  <short>NazoOS Waydroid out</short>
  <description>Forwards connections from the Android container (Waydroid) to the internet and the local network.</description>
  <ingress-zone name="nazoos-waydroid"/>
  <egress-zone name="ANY"/>
</policy>
